<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Reilly, John on Chege's Blog</title><link>https://www.curiosities.dev/cited-authors/Reilly-John/</link><description>Recent content in Reilly, John on Chege's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.curiosities.dev/cited-authors/Reilly-John/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Dev Environment for C#</title><link>https://www.curiosities.dev/computer-science/programming-challenges/language-concepts/dev-setups/csharp/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.curiosities.dev/computer-science/programming-challenges/language-concepts/dev-setups/csharp/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;See &lt;code&gt;dotnet new list&lt;/code&gt; for recipes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="write-code-and-exercise-it-using-tests"&gt;Write Code and Exercise It Using Tests&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet new classlib --name Foo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet new mstest --name Foo.Tests
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet reference add Foo/Foo.csproj --project Foo.Tests/Foo.Tests.csproj
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet new solution --name Foo
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet solution Foo.slnx add Foo/Foo.csproj
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet solution Foo.slnx add Foo.Tests/Foo.Tests.csproj
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Packages worth adding:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet add package ExhaustiveMatching.Analyzer
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;dotnet add package FluentAssertions&lt;/code&gt; in the tests project for more ergonomic
test assertion style.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="formatting-and-linting"&gt;Formatting and Linting&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;dotnet new editorconfig --empty &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;hellip; and have &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;EnforceCodeStyleInBuild&amp;gt;true&amp;lt;/EnforceCodeStyleInBuild&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; in the
&lt;code&gt;.csproj&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;span class="citation-ref"&gt;&lt;a href="#Reilly2022"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>